(85,87,83)\">Run </span><a style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:dotted;color:rgb(85,87,83)\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\">rlang::last_trace(drop = FALSE)</a><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(85,87,83)\"> to see 4 hidden frames.</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">\r\n</span></span><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:blue\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">rlang::last_trace(drop = FALSE)\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(52,101,164)\">&lt;error/rlib_error_dots_named&gt;</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(196,160,0)\">Error</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold\"> in </span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(114,159,207)\">`unite()`</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold\">:</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(196,160,0)\">!</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(8,8,8)\"> Arguments in `...` must be passed by position, not name.</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(204,0,0)\">✖</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(8,8,8)\"> Problematic argument:</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(6,152,154)\">•</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(8,8,8)\"> destrand = TRUE</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">\r\n---\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold\">Backtrace:</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(85,87,83)\">    </span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">▆\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(85,87,83)\"> 1. </span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">└─</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(114,159,207)\">tidyr::unite(</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">normalized.myobj, destrand = TRUE</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(114,159,207)\">)</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(85,87,83)\"> 2. </span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">  └─</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold\">rlang</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">::check_dots_unnamed()\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(85,87,83)\"> 3. </span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">    └─rlang:::action_dots(...)\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(85,87,83)\"> 4. </span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">      ├─</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold\">base</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\"> (local) try_dots(...)\r\n</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;color:rgb(85,87,83)\"> 5. </span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\">      └─</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;font-weight:bold\">rlang</span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px\"> (local) action(...)</span></span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div><div>Emily</div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div></div></div><div dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\" dir=\"auto\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;methylkit_discussion&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\">methylkit_discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/methylkit_discussion/2f579429-1629-4a54-953c-2f6487bd0a22n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/methylkit_discussion/2f579429-1629-4a54-953c-2f6487bd0a22n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230662869000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19_WVwIGee2PbRT3gQe0uE\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/methylkit_discussion/2f57